      "extract": "Chiral symmetry of massless Quantum Chromodynamics has become the key tool in the study of the very low-energy domain of strong interactions (typically $E \\sim M_{\\pi}$), where QCD turns non-perturbative. It is indeed the guiding principle in the construction of Chiral Perturbation Theory ($\\chi PT$), the effective field theory of QCD in this energy region [@Weinberg:1978kz; @Gasser:1983yg; @Gasser:1984gg]. The",
