      "extract": "As illustrated in the ${\\cal O}(p^4)$ case \\cite{Ecker:1988te,Ecker:1989yg} a procedure to systematically determine the resonance contributions to the LECs in $\\chi PT$ is available. Essentially the idea is to construct a Lagrangian theory in terms of resonances, pseudoscalar mesons and auxiliary fields respecting the underlying chiral symmetry. Then, upon integration of the heavier states, the $\\chi PT$ Lagrangian",
