      ],
      "extract": "In Ref. [11] we have constructed the RχT Lagrangian needed to evalu- ate the resonance contributions to the O(p6) LECs in Eq. (2). It has the following structure : LRχT = LχP T 2 + LGB 4 + LGB 6 + LR kin + LR (2) + LR (4) + LRR (2) + LRRR (0) + Lε . (5) The inclusion of spin-1 resonances has been performed within the antisym- metric tensor formalism. However there are independent contributions to the O(p6) LECs",
