      "extract": "+ (0) Kℓ3 decays have the potential to provide one of the most accurate de- terminations of the Vus CKM element. The main uncertainty in extracting this parameter comes from theoretical calculations of the vector form factor f K0π− + (0) deﬁned by : ⟨π−(p) | sγµu | K0(q) ⟩= f K0π− + (t) (q + p)µ + f K0π− − (t) (q −p)µ , (6) with t = (q −p)2. Deviations of f K0π− + (0) from unity (the octet symmetry limit) are of",
